    "codeSnippet": "Integer p, q, r\nSet p = 8, q = 5, r = 10\nif ((p & q) < r)\n    q = r & r\n    p = 9 + q\nend if\nif (p + q > r - p)\n    q = (q + 5) & p\nend if\nPrint (p + q + r)",
