    "codeSnippet": "Integer arr[8] = {15, 24, 33, 42, 55, 66, 77, 88}\nfor (Integer i = 0 to 7)\n    arr[i] = arr[i] - ((i mod 7) * 3)\n    if (i mod 11 == 0)\n        arr[i] = arr[i] + ((i / 11) * 2)\n    end if\nend for\nPrint arr[1], arr[4], arr[7]",
    "codeLanguage": "pseudocode"
